ure-letsuan-design.jpg", "caption": "Letsuan Design | R.O.C. Air Force Academy 90th Founding Anniversary — Construction team installing archway feature wall"}], "author": {"@id": "https://letsuan.com/#organization"}, "datePublished": "2019", "dateModified": "2026-09-21", "hasPart": [{"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "The Exhibition Runs on a Timeline"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Visual Aesthetics and Display Detail"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "Closing"}], "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://letsuan.com/#website"}, "location": {"@type": "Place", "name": "Kaohsiung, Taiwan"}, "startDate": "2019", "subjectOf": {"@type": "VideoObject", "name": "莒光園地 2019.9.19－空軍官校 90周年校慶", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DIxkrSRlgyM", "uploadDate": "2019-09-19", "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "CTS (華視)"}}}, {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://letsuan.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Portfolio", "item": "https://letsuan.com/portfolio"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "R.O.C Air Force Academy 90th Anniversary", "item": "https://letsuan.com/project-air-force-academy"}]}];
